  "description": "☕🤎 Cozy coffee-themed watercolor clipart collection featuring 21 elegant illustrations inspired by specialty coffee shops, slow mornings, artisan cafés, and comforting coffee rituals. This collection includes coffee beans, brewing equipment, coffee drinks, pastries, desserts, and charming café-inspired compositions in a warm neutral palette. Designed with simplified details and clean watercolor rendering, these illustrations are perfect for coffee lovers, café branding, recipe books, stationery, and cozy lifestyle projects.\n✨ Perfect for:\n• Print on Demand products\n• Recipe books and cookbooks\n• Café branding and packaging\n• Stickers and sticker sheets\n• Scrapbooking projects\n• Social media graphics\n• Digital and printable crafts\n💖 What’s included:\n– 21 high-quality illustrations\n– Transparent background\n– High resolution – 300 DPI (perfect for print & digital use)\n– 21 PNG files (transparent background)\n– 21 SVG files\n☕ Included illustrations:\nCoffee beans with wooden scoop, kraft coffee bag with coffee beans, vintage hand coffee grinder, Turkish coffee pot with Turkish delight, stovetop moka pot, home espresso machine, espresso with chocolate, cappuccino with latte art, layered latte, iced latte, affogato dessert, tiramisu slice, cinnamon roll with cream cheese frosting, artisan biscotti bundle, glass jar of coffee candies, glass jar of café cookies, vintage coffee cart, barista coffee corner, breakfast tray with croissant and coffee, coffee and macarons tray, and cozy book with latte and reading glasses.\n✨ This collection captures the atmosphere of cozy cafés, slow mornings, and artisan coffee culture. The combination of brewing tools, coffee drinks, pastries, desserts, and lifestyle-inspired compositions creates a versatile collection that works beautifully for café branding, stationery, recipe books, planners, social media content, packaging design, and coffee-themed POD products.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>☕🤎 Cozy coffee-themed watercolor clipart collection featuring 21 elegant illustrations inspired by specialty coffee shops, slow mornings, artisan cafés, and comforting coffee rituals. This collection includes coffee beans, brewing equipment, coffee drinks, pastries, desserts, and charming café-inspired compositions in a warm neutral palette. Designed with simplified details and clean watercolor rendering, these illustrations are perfect for coffee lovers, café branding, recipe books, stationery, and cozy lifestyle projects.</p>\n<p>✨ Perfect for:<br>\n• Print on Demand products<br>\n• Recipe books and cookbooks<br>\n• Café branding and packaging<br>\n• Stickers and sticker sheets<br>\n• Scrapbooking projects<br>\n• Social media graphics<br>\n• Digital and printable crafts</p>\n<p>💖 What’s included:<br>\n– 21 high-quality illustrations<br>\n– Transparent background<br>\n– High resolution – 300 DPI (perfect for print &amp; digital use)<br>\n– 21 PNG files (transparent background)<br>\n– 21 SVG files</p>\n<p>☕ Included illustrations:<br>\nCoffee beans with wooden scoop, kraft coffee bag with coffee beans, vintage hand coffee grinder, Turkish coffee pot with Turkish delight, stovetop moka pot, home espresso machine, espresso with chocolate, cappuccino with latte art, layered latte, iced latte, affogato dessert, tiramisu slice, cinnamon roll with cream cheese frosting, artisan biscotti bundle, glass jar of coffee candies, glass jar of café cookies, vintage coffee cart, barista coffee corner, breakfast tray with croissant and coffee, coffee and macarons tray, and cozy book with latte and reading glasses.</p>\n<p>✨ This collection captures the atmosphere of cozy cafés, slow mornings, and artisan coffee culture. The combination of brewing tools, coffee drinks, pastries, desserts, and lifestyle-inspired compositions creates a versatile collection that works beautifully for café branding, stationery, recipe books, planners, social media content, packaging design, and coffee-themed POD products.</p>",
